#: ../../tutorials/mixed_variable.md:7
msgid "Mixed-Variable Optimization"
msgstr "混合変数最適化"

#: ../../tutorials/mixed_variable.md:9
msgid ""
"Solve problems that include not only continuous variables but also "
"integer and categorical variables, using `saealib`."
msgstr "連続変数だけでなく、整数変数やカテゴリ変数を含む問題を、`saealib`で解きます。"

#: ../../tutorials/mixed_variable.md:11
msgid ""
"With `minimize()`, you can specify strings or instances for the "
"algorithm, surrogate model, and evaluation strategy. The examples on this"
" page add only problem-specific settings and use defaults for everything "
"else."
msgstr "`minimize()`では、アルゴリズム、サロゲートモデル、評価戦略に文字列またはインスタンスを指定できます。このページの例では問題固有の設定だけを追加し、それ以外はすべて既定値を使います。"

#: ../../tutorials/mixed_variable.md:14
msgid "What you'll be able to do"
msgstr "このページでできるようになること"

#: ../../tutorials/mixed_variable.md:17
msgid ""
"By the end of this page, you'll be able to define continuous, integer, "
"and categorical variables in a `Problem` and run type-aware search."
msgstr "このページを終えると、連続・整数・カテゴリ変数を`Problem`に定義し、型に対応した探索を実行できます。"

#: ../../tutorials/mixed_variable.md:20
msgid ""
"For ordinary continuous variables, use the [high-level "
"API](highlevel_api.md); to add custom variables or operators, see [Custom"
" components](custom_components.md). This page defines variable types in a"
" `Problem` and runs search with type-aware built-in operators."
msgstr "通常の連続変数だけなら[高レベルAPI](highlevel_api.md)を使い、独自の変数や演算子を追加する場合は[独自コンポーネント](custom_components.md)を参照してください。このページでは`Problem`に変数型を定義し、型に対応した組み込み演算子で探索を実行します。"

#: ../../tutorials/mixed_variable.md:23
msgid "Set up the problem"
msgstr "問題を設定する"

#: ../../tutorials/mixed_variable.md:25
msgid ""
"Assume an objective function where each design variable is one of three "
"types: continuous, integer, or categorical."
msgstr "設計変数ごとに、連続値、整数値、カテゴリの3種類が混在する目的関数を想定します。"

#: ../../tutorials/mixed_variable.md:33
msgid ""
"`x[2]` represents one of three categories (`0`, `1`, `2`), and no penalty"
" is applied only when `1` is chosen."
msgstr "`x[2]`は3つのカテゴリ(`0`, `1`, `2`)のいずれかを表す値で、`1`を選んだときだけペナルティが付きません。"

#: ../../tutorials/mixed_variable.md:35
msgid "Define variables"
msgstr "変数の定義"

#: ../../tutorials/mixed_variable.md:37
msgid ""
"Each dimension's type is specified with a subclass of `Variable`, passed "
"to `Problem`'s `variables` argument."
msgstr "各次元の型は`Variable`のサブクラスで指定し、`Problem`の`variables`引数に渡します。"

#: ../../tutorials/mixed_variable.md:14
msgid "Class"
msgstr "クラス"

#: ../../tutorials/mixed_variable.md:14
msgid "Meaning"
msgstr "意味"

#: ../../tutorials/mixed_variable.md:14
msgid "`ContinuousVariable(lb, ub)`"
msgstr "`ContinuousVariable(lb, ub)`"

#: ../../tutorials/mixed_variable.md:14
msgid ""
"Continuous value. A regular `Problem` with `lb`/`ub` omitted is treated "
"as this type"
msgstr "連続値。`lb`/`ub`を省略した通常の`Problem`はこの型として扱われる"

#: ../../tutorials/mixed_variable.md:14
msgid "`IntegerVariable(lb, ub)`"
msgstr "`IntegerVariable(lb, ub)`"

#: ../../tutorials/mixed_variable.md:14
msgid "Integer value"
msgstr "整数値"

#: ../../tutorials/mixed_variable.md:14
msgid "`CategoricalVariable(categories)`"
msgstr "`CategoricalVariable(categories)`"

#: ../../tutorials/mixed_variable.md:14
msgid "Selects one from a list of categories"
msgstr "カテゴリのリストから1つを選ぶ"

#: ../../tutorials/mixed_variable.md:64
msgid ""
"Passing `variables` automatically derives `Problem.lb`/`Problem.ub` from "
"each element's `lb`/`ub`, so you don't specify the `lb`/`ub` arguments."
msgstr "`variables`を渡すと、各要素の`lb`/`ub`から`Problem.lb`/`Problem.ub`が自動的に導出されるため、`lb`/`ub`引数は指定しません。"

#: ../../tutorials/mixed_variable.md:66
msgid "Run minimize"
msgstr "minimizeを実行する"

#: ../../tutorials/mixed_variable.md:75
msgid ""
"`GA` comes with dedicated crossover and mutation operators for each "
"variable type by default (`CrossoverIntegerSBX`/`MutationIntegerUniform` "
"for integers, `CrossoverCategorical`/`MutationCategorical` for "
"categorical variables), so passing `variables` alone gives you type-aware"
" search."
msgstr "`GA`は、変数の型ごとに専用の交叉と突然変異の演算子（整数用の`CrossoverIntegerSBX`/`MutationIntegerUniform`、カテゴリ変数用の`CrossoverCategorical`/`MutationCategorical`）を既定で備えており、`variables`を渡すだけで型に応じた探索が行われます。"

#: ../../tutorials/mixed_variable.md:77
msgid ""
"`PSO` is a velocity-based update scheme and cannot correctly handle "
"integer and categorical variables."
msgstr "`PSO`は速度に基づく更新方式のため、整数変数とカテゴリ変数を正しく扱えません。"

#: ../../tutorials/mixed_variable.md:79
msgid "For mixed-variable problems, stick with `algorithm='GA'` (the default)."
msgstr "混合変数問題では`algorithm='GA'`（既定）のまま使ってください。"

#: ../../tutorials/mixed_variable.md:81
msgid "Customize operators"
msgstr "演算子のカスタマイズ"

#: ../../tutorials/mixed_variable.md:83
msgid ""
"The operators for integer and categorical variables can also be specified"
" individually via `GA`'s keyword arguments."
msgstr "整数変数用とカテゴリ変数用の演算子も、`GA`のキーワード引数で個別に指定できます。"

#: ../../tutorials/mixed_variable.md:112
msgid ""
"See [Algorithm](../concepts/search_algorithms/algorithm.md) for details "
"on each operator."
msgstr "各演算子の詳細は[Algorithm](../concepts/search_algorithms/algorithm.md)を参照してください。"

